    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.52,
      "end_seconds": 125.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.18,
      "end_seconds": 142.51,
      "duration_seconds": 16.33,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. My husband and I live above the shop. I look after my grandchildren most days. I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.22,
      "end_seconds": 146.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.64,
      "end_seconds": 155.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.85,
      "end_seconds": 164.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.94,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Right, so an underactive thyroid is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.37,
      "end_seconds": 185.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.19,
      "end_seconds": 200.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.84,
      "end_seconds": 225.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, heart rate 77, temperature 36.5, BP is 114 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.84,
      "end_seconds": 232.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.69,
      "end_seconds": 236.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "tell me if that's sore"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.44,
      "end_seconds": 254.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Your pulse is steady and your thyroid feels normal in size."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.26,
      "end_seconds": 267.87,
      "duration_seconds": 9.61,
      "text": "you can sit up now having listened and examined, I think we're dealing with well-controlled thyroid replacement at this stage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.88,
      "end_seconds": 271.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.34,
      "end_seconds": 280.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.15,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like well-controlled thyroid replacement, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.13,
      "end_seconds": 300.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.01,
      "text": "A thyroid blood test is what I'd like next, for annual review. Okay, does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.98,
      "end_seconds": 304.19,
